      <h1>Artists We Met</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        &ldquo;Everybody is a Star&rdquo; is what Sly Stone sang in 1970, and to us everybody
        on this list is a Star! Since 1993 we&rsquo;ve met many artists — sometimes just
        a short chat, sometimes a lengthy interview for &ldquo;In the Basement&rdquo; magazine.
        Each time we recorded a station ID for Fingerpoppin Soul and took some
        pictures. Since 2003 many of the artists on this list received a book of
        rare picture-sleeve 45s. So here we go, A–Z — there are still a couple of
        artists we&rsquo;d really like to meet&hellip;
      </p>

